<resources>
    <string name="wgsetup_title">Set up WireGuard</string>
    <string name="wgsetup_explainer">Links the car to your home network via WireGuard. Addresses listed in AllowedIPs, such as your Home Assistant server, go through the link. All other traffic goes the usual way. Use the client (peer) file from your router, for example from OPNsense, Fritz!Box or wg-easy.</string>

