    <string name="wgsetup_phone_title">Continue on your phone</string>
    <string name="wgsetup_phone_steps">Scan the code and sign in. Then upload or paste the file from your router. Your phone must be able to reach the car: same WLAN, the car hotspot, or an active tunnel.</string>
    <string name="wgsetup_phone_lan_note">Only do this in your own WLAN or the car hotspot.</string>
    <string name="wgsetup_phone_no_url">No address yet. Put the car on a WLAN, switch on the hotspot or start a tunnel first.</string>

